
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Volunteer as Volunteer User
    participant UI as React Frontend (:5173)
    participant API as FastAPI Router (:8000)
    participant RecSys as Recommendation Service
    participant DB as SQLite (volunteer.db)

    Volunteer->>UI: Selects Profile Preferences (Activity Types, Skills, Max Hours)
    UI->>API: PUT /api/users/{id}/preferences
    API->>DB: Persist Profile & Rebuild profile_text
    DB-->>API: Profile Saved
    API-->>UI: Updated User Object
    
    Volunteer->>UI: Clicks "Test Recommendation Methods"
    UI->>API: POST /api/recommend/compare (mode, user_id)
    API->>RecSys: Dispatch compare_recommendations(user_id, method, k=10)
    
    Note over RecSys,DB: Stage 0: Strict Pre-Filter
    RecSys->>DB: SELECT * FROM events WHERE duration <= max_hours AND languages match
    DB-->>RecSys: 194 canonical events -> N eligible candidates
    
    par Strategy A: Sparse TF-IDF
        RecSys->>RecSys: Load Vectorizer & Compute Sparse Cosine Similarity
    and Strategy B: Dense Bi-Encoder
        RecSys->>DB: Fetch 384-dim BLOB embeddings
        RecSys->>RecSys: Model.encode(profile_text) & Matrix Dot Product
    and Strategy C: Two-Stage Cross-Encoder
        RecSys->>RecSys: Stage 1: Dense Retrieval Top-15
        RecSys->>RecSys: Stage 2: Cross-Encoder Token Attention Reranking
    end
    
    RecSys-->>API: Return Top-K Ranked List + Scores + Latency (ms)
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (JSON Payload)
    UI-->>Volunteer: Render Interactive Recommendations Card Deck
